# feat-018 — keep the agent-service image lean AND keep secrets/artifacts out of build layers.
# CRITICAL: .env (real keys) must NEVER enter an image layer. It is excluded here even though the
# Dockerfile only COPYs specific dirs — defense in depth.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/

# Not needed at runtime (the service only imports avery/ + service/ + reads skills/ + memory/):
runs/
cases/
tests/
scenarios/
office-ai-capture/
for-partner/
*.md
!README.md
